    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18353" root="زو" body-key="z">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُىَّ عَلَيْنَا</span></b> , or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِىَّ</span>, (accord. to different copies
of the S, in the TA <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُىَّ</span>,) [from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَوٌّ</span>, originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُوِوَ</span>, then <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُوِىَ</span>, and then <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُىَّ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِىَّ</span>,] or it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُوِىَ</span>,
(thus in some copies of the S,) <i>It was decreed
against us.</i> (S.)

